{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An endless labyrinth, three levels, three floors\u2026 and no mistakes allowed.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BAD SECTOR \u00b3</strong> is a psychological horror game where every room may conceal corruptions you must detect to move forward. Make <strong>three mistakes</strong>, and you\u2019ll be thrown back to the previous floor\u2026 forced to start all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through an <strong>unstable structure</strong> that <strong>reshapes itself with every attempt</strong>: rooms shift, turning the path ahead into an unpredictable maze. The mechanical irises will grant you access to the following sectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Three levels, each with multiple floors to overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An architecture that resets after every trial, ensuring unique runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A progression\u2013regression system that puts your nerves to the test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Three difficulty modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Automatic save system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Anomaly log to track your progress and obtain clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam leaderboards and achievements to challenge your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > First full run: 2\u20133 hours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Corrupted, the structure cannot repair itself.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It summons you</strong>, twisting your desire to escape <strong>into a tool for its own survival.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Make a Choice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3798290/de79acfb93b61d217cf19479d343dade986dff4e.jpg"},{"name":"Game Ove